{{--
    Cal. Civ. Code § 8416(a)(8): the Notice of Mechanics Lien that every
    California claim of mechanics lien must include, "printed in at least
    10-point boldface type", with the last sentence in uppercase except the
    Contractors' State License Board web address. Verbatim from
    leginfo.legislature.ca.gov, verified 2026-09-29. Never edit without
